                                <p><strong>Module:</strong> COMP2611 - Artificial Intelligence</p>
                                <p><strong>Institution:</strong> University of Leeds</p>
                                <p><strong>Year:</strong> 2023/24 (Year 2)</p>
                                <p><strong>Assessment:</strong> Coursework 2 (20% weight)</p>
                                <p><strong>Format:</strong> Python programming assignment</p>
