                                <p><strong>Type:</strong> Individual assignment</p>
                                <p><strong>Focus:</strong> Implementing machine learning</p>
                                <p><strong>Tasks:</strong> 10 programming tasks</p>
                                <p><strong>Scope:</strong> Financial fraud detection</p>
                                <p><strong>Technology:</strong> Python, Scikit-learn, Pandas</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

