                                    <li>• Machine learning for security monitoring</li>
                                    <li>• Predictive models for managing risk</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

                <!-- Programming Tasks & Implementation -->
                <ProjectSection Title="Programming Tasks & Implementation" Subtitle="10 tasks covering the full ML pipeline" Icon="fas fa-tasks">
                    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">Data Processing Tasks</h3>
                            <ul class="text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-1">
                                <li><strong>Task 1-3:</strong> Loading and exploring the data</li>
                                <li><strong>Task 4:</strong> Feature preprocessing and scaling</li>
                                <li><strong>Task 5:</strong> Finding and handling outliers</li>
                                <li><strong>Task 6:</strong> Splitting into training and test sets</li>
                                <li><strong>Statistical analysis:</strong> Correlation matrices</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">Model Development Tasks</h3>
                            <ul class="text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-1">
                                <li><strong>Task 7:</strong> Training the decision tree</li>
                                <li><strong>Task 8:</strong> Pruning and tuning the model</li>
                                <li><strong>Task 9:</strong> Cross-validation</li>
                                <li><strong>Task 10:</strong> Evaluating performance metrics</li>
                                <li><strong>Extra:</strong> Hyperparameter tuning</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
