                            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">Pruning Techniques</h3>
                            <ul class="text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-1">
                                <li>• Pre-pruning (early stopping)</li>
                                <li>• Post-pruning (reducing complexity)</li>
                                <li>• Cost-complexity pruning</li>
                                <li>• Tuning the minimum samples per leaf</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">Cross-Validation</h3>
                            <ul class="text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-1">
                                <li>• K-fold cross-validation</li>
                                <li>• Stratified sampling</li>
                                <li>• Validation curves</li>
                                <li>• Learning curves</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-100 mb-3">Performance Metrics</h3>
                            <ul class="text-sm text-slate-300 space-y-1">
                                <li>• Accuracy and precision</li>
                                <li>• Recall and F1-score</li>
                                <li>• ROC-AUC curves</li>
                                <li>• Reading the confusion matrix</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </ProjectSection>

